request: re-split instead of failing when the replica selector is exhausted,
with a fresh selector for every re-split batch

client-go answers an exhausted replica selector (SendReqCtx with rpcCtx == nil)
with an EpochNotMatch region error that the owning caller backs off on
(BoRegionMiss) and re-splits; every re-split batch gets a new
RegionRequestSender and therefore a new replica selector.

